      "agent_response": {
        "response": "Here are the Q3 2026 won deals for **James Okafor** and **Sofia Delgado** (deals D001, D002, D003, D005, D006, D008) from `sales_q3.csv`:\n\n---\n\n### Won Deals Detail\n\n| Deal ID | Sales Rep | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|-----------------|--------|---------------------------|----------:|------------|\n| D001 | James Okafor | North | Meridian Insights Pro | $87,500 | 2026-07-05 |\n| D002 | Sofia Delgado | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $62,000 | 2026-07-08 |\n| D003 | James Okafor | East | Meridian DataBridge | $43,000 | 2026-07-12 |\n| D005 | Sofia Delgado | North | Meridian DataBridge | $55,000 | 2026-07-19 |\n| D006 | James Okafor | South | Meridian Insights Pro | $120,000 | 2026-07-22 |\n| D008 | Sofia Delgado | West | Meridian DataBridge | $38,000 | 2026-08-02 |\n\n---\n\n### Summary by Rep\n\n- **James Okafor** \u2014 3 won deals totaling **$250,500**\n  - Largest deal: D006 ($120,000, Meridian Insights Pro, South region)\n  - Products: 2\u00d7 Meridian Insights Pro, 1\u00d7 Meridian DataBridge\n\n- **Sofia Delgado** \u2014 3 won deals totaling **$155,000**\n  - Largest deal: D002 ($62,000, Meridian Insights Pro, South region)\n  - Products: 1\u00d7 Meridian Insights Pro, 2\u00d7 Meridian DataBridge\n\n- **Combined** \u2014 6 deals totaling **$405,500**\n\nAll six deals closed between early July and early August 2026, with five closing in July and one (D008) in August.",
